  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 508.01 Applicability. An owner or operator who wishes to obtain a waiver from any requirement established by a rule in this chapter shall request the waiver as specified in Env-Or 508.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-23",
